OL,3,APolanski says he will not overturn
OL,4,AGreen Party's 'Zionism is racism'
OL,5,Amotion
OL,6,
OL,7,FZack Polanski has said he will not
OL,8,Foverturn a motion passed by Green Party
OL,9,Fmembers that declared Zionism a form of
OL,10,Fracism.
OL,12,FThe Green leader told Sunday with Laura
OL,13,FKuenssberg that, while he would like to
OL,14,Fmake amendments, it would be party
OL,15,Fpolicy until 2028.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
