OL,3,APolanski says he will not overturn
OL,4,AGreen Party's 'Zionism is racism'
OL,5,Amotion
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe motion, passed at the party's
OL,8,Fconference earlier this month,
OL,9,Fdescribed Zionism as an ideology
OL,10,Fsupporting "an ethnonationalist Jewish
OL,11,Fstate in historic Palestine to the
OL,12,Fexclusion and/or domination of the
OL,13,Fnon-Jewish population".
OL,15,FIt divided the party and sparked a
OL,16,Fmajor backlash from MPs, Jewish
OL,17,Fcampaigners, the government and the
OL,18,FEuropean Green movement, with the
OL,19,Fequality watchdog writing to the party
OL,20,Ffor more information on it.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
