OL,3,AEnding corridor care in hospitals for
OL,4,Achildren a priority, says health
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was speaking on Sunday with Laura
OL,8,FKuenssberg where the programme
OL,9,Fhighlighted the case of two-year-old
OL,10,FFinlay Roberts who died in 2024 after
OL,11,Fspending hours in a hospital corridor
OL,12,Fbefore being discharged.
OL,14,FThe health secretary has announced
OL,15,F#140m to improve urgent care in England
OL,16,Fahead of what she said would be a "more
OL,17,Fdifficult" winter than usual.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
