OL,3,AFour killed and dozens seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in major fire at Canadian
OL,5,Amilitary base, Carney says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour service members have been killed
OL,8,Fand dozens wounded after a fire at a
OL,9,FCanadian military base, Prime Minister
OL,10,FMark Carney says - here's what we know
OL,11,Fso far
OL,13,FCarney says it's "one of the worst
OL,14,Ftragedies" for the military in
OL,15,Fpeacetime, as he describes a "violent,
OL,16,Ffast-moving" fire on Saturday
OL,18,F"It was like a scene out of a war
OL,19,Fmovie," says a hospital resident who
OL,20,Fwitnessed a military vehicle and
OL,21,Fambulances bringing injured people in
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
