OL,5,
OL,6,FFew details about what triggered the
OL,7,Fdeadly fire at Canadian Forces Base
OL,8,FWainwright, which broke out at around
OL,9,F16:00 local time (22:00 GMT), have been
OL,10,Fconfirmed by authorities so far.
